@page "/docs/api-reference/logout"
@layout DocsLayout
@attribute [AllowAnonymous]

<PageTitle>Logout — Vaultex API</PageTitle>

<div class="docs-eyebrow">API reference</div>
<h1>Logout</h1>
<p class="docs-lead">
    Ends the user's Vaultex session and optionally redirects them back to your app. Also known as
    the <strong>end_session</strong> endpoint.
</p>

<div class="docs-endpoint">
    <span class="docs-method docs-method--get">GET</span>
    <span>/connect/logout</span>
</div>

<h2 id="parameters">Query parameters</h2>
<table>
    <thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Required</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
        <tr><td><code>id_token_hint</code></td><td>Recommended</td><td>The user's ID token. Lets Vaultex skip the confirmation prompt.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>post_logout_redirect_uri</code></td><td>Optional</td><td>Where to send the user after sign-out. Must match a registered URI.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>state</code></td><td>Optional</td><td>Returned unchanged on the post-logout redirect.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>client_id</code></td><td>Optional</td><td>Identifies the requesting client for logging.</td></tr>
    </tbody>
</table>

<h2 id="example">Example</h2>
<div class="docs-codeblock">
    <div class="docs-codeblock-header">
        <span class="docs-codeblock-lang">URL</span>
        <button class="docs-codeblock-copy" onclick="vxCopy(this)">Copy</button>
    </div>
<pre><code>https://auth.vaultex.io/connect/logout?
  id_token_hint=eyJhbGciOi...
  &amp;post_logout_redirect_uri=https%3A%2F%2Fyourapp.com
  &amp;state=xyz</code></pre>
</div>

<div class="docs-callout docs-callout--info">
    <span class="docs-callout-icon">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M11 7h2v2h-2zm0 4h2v6h-2zm1-9C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2z"/></svg>
    </span>
    <div class="docs-callout-body">
        <div class="docs-callout-title">Clear your local session too</div>
        <p>Hitting <code>/connect/logout</code> ends the Vaultex session, but your app still has its own cookie. Clear that as part of your sign-out flow.</p>
    </div>
</div>

